# Encroaching Dragonstorm ({3}{G}): "When this enchantment enters, search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them
# onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle." Cast with Black Lotus's {G}{G}{G} and Mox Emerald; only basic lands may be found
# (not a Tropical Island, not Llanowar Elves) and no more than two, and the Forests enter tapped. "When a Dragon you control
# enters, return this enchantment to its owner's hand": an Ornithopter (not a Dragon) leaves it in play on turn 3; Sagu Wildling
# (a Dragon, cast with a Forest and four Moxen's mana) returns it.

